  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"K\u0131l\u0131\xE7 \xDC\xE7l\xFCs\xFC\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    se\xE7tin.\n\nBu kart\u0131n \xFCzerinde biraz a\u015Fk\u0131n, biraz da ikili
    ili\u015Fkilerin parmak izleri vard\u0131r. Kafan\u0131 kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rm\u0131\u015F,
    seni k\xF6\u015Feye s\u0131k\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rm\u0131\u015F ve ikilemlerde
    b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015F ac\u0131lar \xE7ekti\u011Fini, incindi\u011Fini i\u015Faret
    eder. Birisi seni hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131na u\u011Fratm\u0131\u015F
    {{isim}}. \xC7ok de\u011Fer verdi\u011Fin o ki\u015Fiden hi\xE7 beklemedi\u011Fin
    ve hak etmedi\u011Fin kar\u015F\u0131l\u0131klar g\xF6rmek, seni derinden yaralam\u0131\u015F.
    Burada alt\u0131n\u0131n \xE7izilmesi gerek \u015Fey ise \u015Fu; zaman, y\xFCre\u011Findeki
    elem ve kedere melhem olmu\u015F. Takvim yapraklar\u0131 s\xF6k\xFCld\xFCk\xE7e
    her \u015Feyin nas\u0131l da iyile\u015Fti\u011Fini g\xF6rm\xFC\u015F, her durumda
    kendini toparlayabilece\u011Fini anlam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Ya\u015Fananlar\u0131
    kabullenmenin ve erdemli bir \u015Fekilde sabretmenin \xF6nemi senin g\xF6z\xFCnde
    yeniden kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015F."
